        Weiter folgt unser Arbeitsangebot in der Englischen 
          und Deutschen Sprache.
          Es wird von uns bevorzugt, wenn Sie auf Englisch antworten.
        This offer for EUROPEAN COUNTRIES only!
        Job for students, 
          home-workers and people 
          which have free 2-3 hours a day.
      Dear Sir/Madam,
          
          We're glad to offer you a position in our company Donation=20=
Europe.
          We are a charity organization in Central Europe. 
        We help and support the community in Europe to help children of=20=
all ages.
        Donation Europe is an organization which supported by donations.
        All information about us you can read at our web-site.
        You can earn money and help children with us.
        We are looking for freelance representatives in EUROPEAN=20=
COUNTRIES.
        Donation Europe receive donations in Europe, you have a=20=
possibility to
        become a "Freelance representative" of our company.
        You do not need any funds to work and you do not need to find=20=
anybody.
        We hire people for freelance work.
        You can combine it with your full-time work, 2-3 hours a day=20=
are required from you.
        The salary is 300 - 2100 EUR per week.
        If you have an interest to our proposition and have a desire to=20=
help children 
        send your reply to jobineurope@gala.net.
        Our manager will send you more information about the job and=20=
the terms of employment.
                
       REPLY TO jobineurope@gala.net ONLY
       Helen Wilson
        Donation Europe.
      
         Poland
        Nowoursynowska st. 119, 
        02-776 Warsaw
        Phone/Fax:   +48 (22) 389 6535
        Charity Registration No.: 101682
        Company Registration No.: 2350841
      
        
